  "description": "Na-Jin’s mother arranges a date for her with someone Na-Jin’s best friend describes as “nuclear trash.” When she arrives to meet nuclear-trash-man Joo-Hyuk for that date, she comes face-to-face with her reckless one-night stand from the night before. He’s ready to disprove her misconceptions and eager to jump into marriage to make both of their mothers happy. He likes her; she needs him. That’s enough, right? Will she find happiness, or is she doomed to live out this charade to please others?\n\n(source: Tapas)",
